reviewed"},"source":{"sanskritLocator":"4042011","sanskritFile":"Ram04.txt","englishEdition":"M. N. Dutt 1891–94"},"sanskrit_fingerprints":{"exact":"626a9c8a7c6323c00c16f8681232fc01b3aabda7835123f4f753d0b371ca0f7c","compact":"d14b6bcc7fe097b8e35d7ac5fe347253f28fa6f47b4f84b6c2c399af8e02e3b6","nasal":"703f9a945988908742fb5edb992003b7e2f53cc5fbf968c7dcd4ee0074079bf5"}},{"id":"VRCE-4-42-12","kanda":4,"kandaId":"kishkindha","sarga":42,"verse":12,"english":"Having searched there Mlechās, Pulindas, Surasensas, Prasthalas, Bharatas, Kurus, and Madrakas, and Varadas, as well as the cities of Kambojas, Yavanas and Sakas, do you explore Himavān.","alignment":{"type":"grouped","confidence":0.29,"method":"shared-sanskrit-ngram","duttRefs":["DUTT-4-43-9"],"status":"unreviewed"},"source":{"sanskritLocator":"4042012","sanskritFile":"Ram04.txt","englishEdition":"M. N. Dutt 1891–94"},"sanskrit_fingerprints":{"exact":"8190b12766543728adbaaf7578b158359291c606e305ecfa25e68d055bfa898a","compact":"cae010dc19a3370bd09d8c25334ed7101c969794fbe80edc3c9283c435aef8d1","nasal":"9b4130f5afd1becc5c2bba339eda211a364b66a0acc90dd3a7eedbbd826067cd"}},{"id":"VRCE-4-42-13","kanda":4,"kandaId":"kishkindha","sarga":42,"verse":13,"english":"And in tracts of Lodhras and Padmakas, and in Devadāru woods* do you search thoroughly for Ravana along with Videha's daughter. *Belonging, according to the commentator, to Himavān.","alignment":{"type":"1:1","confidence":0.732,"method":"shared-sanskrit-ngram","duttRefs":["DUTT-4-43-10"],"status":"unreviewed"},"source":{"sanskritLocator":"4042013","sanskritFile":"Ram04.txt","englishEdition":"M. N. Dutt 1891–94"},"sanskrit_fingerprints":{"exact":"f3af790313d8370786594899ddee74ea4057c50b26759ef65704c62276ffbca8","compact":"759e81daf90aa743174dcfda64b7c980abd1894a6666ca103210299a84f6b2c4","nasal":"b386c67e4cea7ae8e964b2431de8f286bbfb6c82308976adce125a97578dbd69"}},{"id":"VRCE-4-42-14","kanda":4,"kandaId":"kishkindha","sarga":42,"verse":14,"english":"Then, coming upon the h