 fruits fit to be partaken at all seasons. And other excellent trees bring forth precious beds dight with costly jewels and furnished with variegated covers.","alignment":{"type":"split","confidence":1.0,"method":"shared-sanskrit-ngram","duttRefs":["DUTT-4-43-38","DUTT-4-43-39"],"status":"unreviewed"},"source":{"sanskritLocator":"4042045","sanskritFile":"Ram04.txt","englishEdition":"M. N. Dutt 1891–94"},"sanskrit_fingerprints":{"exact":"986eba4b9447a484e4051d0656369a9da58c64bb04087667d13202795e8e3714","compact":"ede732de4cf8f775205bef13a03b9a3267c90bee21f3bdfc39cbee979d7901d9","nasal":"eaacf35c76993ed7c1e6db5a3116ce1bb1a9f844ea310fa9d597a445d720ae9e"}},{"id":"VRCE-4-42-46","kanda":4,"kandaId":"kishkindha","sarga":42,"verse":46,"english":"Other excellent trees bring forth attires of divers kinds, and ornaments decked with pearls and lapises,-coveted alike by males and females*. *The present text, according to Kataka, drops a sloka, whose last line is, Beings possessed of powerful effulgence, sport here always in company with females. And other excellent trees bear fruits fit to be partaken at all seasons. And other excellent trees bring forth precious beds dight with costly jewels and furnished with variegated covers.","alignment":{"type":"split","confidence":0.676,"method":"shared-sanskrit-ngram","duttRefs":["DUTT-4-43-38","DUTT-4-43-39"],"status":"unreviewed"},"source":{"sanskritLocator":"4042046","sanskritFile":"Ram04.txt","englishEdition":"M. N. Dutt 1891–94"},"sanskrit_fingerprints":{"exact":"c83116c5c7e467f7576ea1acca28f1d8de7b5e0e717cc109df20bfab53466c66","compact":"5497a8fe87ff6d3a08a0f8e32e3e7cd0197e2dabacd64e757a93d433543574f7","nasal":"337482ad88633dccd8e2a7581864c750e62fffd240182c9cca3d488d48333f93"}},{"id":"VRCE-4-42-47","kanda":4,"kandaId":"kishkindha","sarga":42,"verse":47,"english":"And other excellent trees bear fruits fit to be partaken at all seasons. And other excellent trees bring forth precious beds dight with costly jewels and furnished with va